			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Glauc.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δόγμα κολαφθὲν εἰς στάλαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.256
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Phintias</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				952
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Acragas</span>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πολέμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.30
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Demetrias</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Dips.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLeid.X.</u>
				36
			</span></i>.</div>
